## Repeater Loop

```php
<?php
$items = get_field( 'items' );
if ( is_array( $items ) && ! empty( $items ) ) :
	foreach ( $items as $item ) :
		$title = $item['title'] ?? '';
		$image = $item['image'] ?? '';
		$link  = $item['link'] ?? [];
		?>
		<div class="item">
			<?php if ( $title ) : ?>
